{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_title", "source_sha256": "1e1438e102b0ba234b61868b0f5e11fb57d0f4602f6eed6f073960b7e43d9626", "ja": "魔法の時間が過ぎても", "zh": "即使魔法的时间过去", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5c003f5623a4e942793d20ea6853386376bece66f13ad6cc340dc6627852f86c", "ja": "『EmotionLight』公演は大盛況で幕を\n閉じた。惜しむアイドル達に、まだ終わりじ\nゃないと言うプロデューサー。その言葉を受\nけ、次の公演に想いを託しつつ、武道館への\n準備を始めるアイドル達なのだった。", "zh": "“EmotionLight”公演在盛况中落下了帷幕。\n面对心怀依恋的偶像们，制作人表示这还\n没有结束。听到这番话后，偶像们将心意\n寄托于下一场公演，并开始为武道馆做准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a99006897883efd2ab4e9cbdf8dafd6a21cff0a307cff5ce9ae17e8e493842e4", "ja": "（ツアー第3弾『EmotionLight』公演は、\n朝公演、昼公演に続いて、その存在感を見せつけた）", "zh": "（巡演第3弹《EmotionLight》公演，在早场公演、午场公演之后，继续展现出了它的存在感。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1001_p", "source_sha256": "99c68b4459859e285d6554d8248eaadf642055bf88e8bd41e314332bda4a7adc", "ja": "（まさに、マジックアワー……\n誰にとっても心震えるような、魔法の時間だったな！）", "zh": "（真是魔法时刻啊……对任何人来说，都是令人心潮澎湃的魔法般时光！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "864f879692bc1c8031c0173a9a4e1e98376edef306b4e685fec0535807c8b5ba", "ja": "……はぁ～。", "zh": "……呼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "4332a901ca82a5393cb428710283f4e01121ab2c8bf7b2cd3567e215384d0ea3", "ja": "はあぁぁ～……。", "zh": "哈啊啊～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4deb095a9cefed7790424d878afb1f38756483f0ffd5c2fb5f4ef3ba771b9a6b", "ja": "はぁ～。", "zh": "唉——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4002fbe553177f797156b486326e0fa34ac2dce6f78986f8e1d97704f699fd2a", "ja": "っと……みんな、どうしたんだ？\nため息なんかついたりして。", "zh": "等等……大家这是怎么了？\n怎么都唉声叹气的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "226841a7e5c40227a6e16decc0d108f06e8b2428d44bb0374acbea556a462d51", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　お疲れさまです。\nえへへ……ごめんなさい、なんだか気が抜けちゃって。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！辛苦了。\n嘿嘿……不好意思，不知怎么的，一下子就松懈下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "688bf2a98be9e70d753334c0ea4bbd33624cdf5b1a9024cb5ac8a2474e276729", "ja": "うん……ツアー公演、ホント楽しかったからさ～。\nあーあ、終わっちゃったなって……。", "zh": "嗯……巡回公演真的太开心了嘛～。\n唉～心里想着就这么结束了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "27c7c0fc150f67b6dcbc7efe4ce24fd8179c8c17f92fd368ba5b04545a7626e9", "ja": "でもため息っていうよりは、ウットリっていうか……。\nお腹いっぱいで、満足～って感じなんですよね♪", "zh": "不过与其说是在叹气，不如说是陶醉吧……\n就像吃得饱饱的，心满意足～的感觉呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f7bd4856a49235ecc735c600394273f9852a5276794c71fd4e03f106b734f4cb", "ja": "そうか。まあ、気持ちはわかるけど……。\nみんな、燃え尽きるにはまだ早いぞ！", "zh": "这样啊。嗯，我能理解你的心情，不过……\n大家现在就燃尽还太早了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "f6f8e6adf2c85b0ced96641d521440f34f7f9b61dc68734de81839bd11ad5e18", "ja": "そうですよね。次は夜の公演もありますし。\nその先だって……。", "zh": "是啊。接下来还有晚场演出。而且在那之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "466da223df45ad5bb7bcf6537a0790982f46c0184590b0b1eb22d4b45bfe7c6c", "ja": "ハッ！？　そうでした！　アイドルちゃん達の聖地、\n武道館……これは、浸っている場合じゃありません！", "zh": "哈！？对哦！偶像们的圣地——武道馆……现在可不是沉浸其中的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "41da459754d710aa472b6cf96ad0301c899c34d9613220f8aec968915c3717ff", "ja": "そうだね！　それに、ほら……。\nみんなから受け取った、あれも書かないとだし。", "zh": "对哦！而且，你看……  \n还得把大家交给我的那个也写上才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "09041ec9d05ae378b1dca94bc148f52012b80d77004421d5e0472f6d9f50c0a5", "ja": "あっ、そうそう！　アレは気合い入れないとな～。\nみんなはどんなの書く？", "zh": "啊，对了对了！那件事可得好好加把劲写才行～。\n大家准备写什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "71cb662eb5dc21b86eb401445e72fea2f98fdb5f1ba4f24cfeb9e292a769ceed", "ja": "どんな、って言われても……。\n別に、特別なことはないですよ。普通です。", "zh": "要说是什么……也没什么特别的。很普通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "3c94151fcd28d3d8bcd41ff467c30d71313132eed0055b559cb51792833ea102", "ja": "本当かなぁ？　志保ちゃんってクールそうに見えて、\n意外と熱いところあるし。すごいの考えてそう！", "zh": "真的吗？志保看起来很酷，其实也有热情的一面。说不定正琢磨着什么厉害的点子呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "530c411bc931c132069bf462e29896fdb0c953e6e1491cd74b791b1f86e41abb", "ja": "美奈子さん……ハードル上げないでください。", "zh": "美奈子小姐……别把要求抬得这么高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "615dc1bea128c7d9d89917598cd7122665c48db49b0cce146b03cd0ab40be0d4", "ja": "みなさんの作業が済んだら、もう一度\n写真を撮らせてくださいね！　ムフ、ムフフ……♪", "zh": "等大家忙完后，请再让我拍一次照片哦！嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1020_p", "source_sha256": "67cbf417d31e077cd54a47ce40c64dcaf8638ea0d241760737103bc6884aeea7", "ja": "……。おーい！　その話、今しちゃっていいのか？\n例のアレの事だよな？", "zh": "……。喂——！那件事现在说出来真的好吗？\n指的是那件“老规矩”吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "ff782a61e0ef87a29e56eb44d4134c9b07484fde6ac3401b03407f610006c197", "ja": "あっ！？　そうでした！　わっ、どうしよう……？", "zh": "啊！？对哦！哇，怎么办……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1022_p", "source_sha256": "df8e7267cd74c1b91056f5525d2c9da28043c4b79c40820a0ede4ac8fcb7af4f", "ja": "大丈夫、俺はそろそろ仕事に戻るよ。\n楽しみにしてるから、みんなよろしくな！", "zh": "没事的，我差不多该回去工作了。\n我很期待哦，大家就拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "135a246c4aeeb32bd6b561a390cb2d35bbce687caafc8217a3032c7cd9c654bb", "ja": "{$P$}さん……はいっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9cd241bf1c5053942fe54644df681973906080c4f034ce0d780190a97cdbb286", "ja": "（楽しい時間は、いつかは過ぎていく……\nでも、惜しいとは思わないな）", "zh": "（快乐的时光终有一天会过去……\n不过，我并不觉得可惜。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_09_1025_p", "source_sha256": "2d93b0bf6b793647a33d9ffe160b22001fd72ccc1bd3106d1836bff51a4f13d6", "ja": "（アイドルのみんなを見ていれば、次が信じられる。\n最高の時間は、きっとまたやってくることだろう！）", "zh": "（只要看着偶像们，就能相信接下来会发生的事。最棒的时光，一定还会再次到来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
